### Scope Contract 1.2: Homepage Data Fetching Parallelization
**Objective:** Eliminate 1.5s TTFB waterfall by parallelizing 9 homepage data fetches  
**Risk Level:** Medium (modifies critical page)  
**Estimated Duration:** 1-2 days  
**Dependencies:** 1.1 (VFS tests must pass first)

#### Current State
```typescript
// app/(store)/page.tsx — Current (Sequential Waterfall)
const heroData = await getHeroData()           // ~200ms
const featured = await getFeaturedProducts()   // ~200ms
const spotlight1 = await getSpotlight1Data()   // ~200ms
// ... 6 more sequential fetches
// Total: ~1500-1800ms TTFB
```

#### Target State
```typescript
// app/(store)/page.tsx — Target (Parallel)
const [heroData, featured, spotlight1, spotlight2, spotlight3, iems, newest, dacs, accessories] = 
  await Promise.all([
    getHeroData(),
    getFeaturedProducts(),
    getSpotlight1Data(),
    getSpotlight2Data(),
    getSpotlight3Data(),
    getIemProducts(),
    getNewestRelease(),
    getDacProducts(),
    getAccessoryProducts()
  ])
// Total: ~400ms TTFB (limited by slowest fetch)
```

#### DoD Sequence

**DoD 1.2.1 — Create Centralized Homepage Data Fetcher**
- [ ] Create: `app/(store)/lib/fetchHomepageData.ts`
- [ ] Implement: `fetchHomepageData()` function
- [ ] Aggregate: All 9 data fetchers in single function
- [ ] Return: Unified data object with strict typing
- [ ] Verify: TypeScript compilation passes (`npx tsc --noEmit`)

**DoD 1.2.2 — Refactor page.tsx to Use Promise.all**
- [ ] Modify: `app/(store)/page.tsx`
- [ ] Replace: Sequential awaits with Promise.all
- [ ] Pass: Data as props to all 9 homepage components
- [ ] Verify: Components receive pre-fetched data via props
- [ ] Verify: No `await` calls remain in page.tsx

**DoD 1.2.3 — Refactor Homepage Components**
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/Featured/Featured.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/ProductSpotlight1.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/ProductSpotlight2.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/ProductSpotlight3.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/IemsGallery.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/NewestRelease.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/DACs.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: `app/components/features/homepage/Accessories.tsx`
- [ ] Modify: Hero component (if it has internal data fetching)
- [ ] Change: Accept data via props instead of internal `await getData()`
- [ ] Verify: Components render without internal awaits

**DoD 1.2.4 — Add Error Boundary Handling**
- [ ] Implement: Individual component failure doesn't crash page
- [ ] Add: Graceful degradation with fallback content
- [ ] Verify: Simulate API failure, page still renders

**DoD 1.2.5 — Performance Verification**
- [ ] Run: `npm run dev`
- [ ] Open: DevTools → Network tab
- [ ] Verify: All Sanity requests start within 50ms of each other
- [ ] Verify: Total TTFB < 500ms for cached requests
- [ ] Verify: Lighthouse TTFB score = Good (not Poor/Fair)
- [ ] Record: Before/after timing in `PERFORMANCE_RESULTS.md`

**DoD 1.2.6 — Regression Testing**
- [ ] Run: `node tests/regression/run-regression-tests.cjs`
- [ ] Verify: 27/27 tests passing
- [ ] Verify: Homepage renders all 9 sections
- [ ] Verify: No console errors
- [ ] Manual test: Navigate to homepage, verify visual correctness

#### Verification Methods

**Method A — Network Timing Verification:**
```powershell
# 1. Start dev server
npm run dev
# 2. Open Chrome DevTools → Network
# 3. Clear cache, reload page
# 4. Verify: All /data/query Sanity requests have ~same start time
# 5. Screenshot: Network waterfall showing parallel requests
```

**Method B — Lighthouse CI:**
```powershell
npm run lighthouse:ci
# Verify: TTFB score improves from Poor/Fair to Good
```

**Method C — Regression Suite:**
```powershell
node tests/regression/run-regression-tests.cjs
# MUST: 27/27 passing
```

#### Scope Boundaries

**IN SCOPE:**
- Parallel data fetching implementation
- Component prop refactoring
- Error boundary handling
- Performance measurement

**OUT OF SCOPE:**
- React.cache implementation (Scope 1.3)
- unstable_cache implementation (Scope 1.4)
- Component styling changes
- New features

**FORBIDDEN:**
- Do not add new data fetchers
- Do not change data shapes
- Do not modify Sanity schemas
- Do not skip regression tests

#### Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| Component breaks with prop changes | Medium | High | Strict TypeScript interfaces |
| Error boundaries not catching | Low | Medium | Test with simulated failures |
| Performance regression | Low | High | Before/after measurement |

