- [ ] Section: Core Mechanism (state transitions)
- [ ] Section: Correctness Pillars
  | Pillar | Requirement | Verification |
  |--------|-------------|--------------|
  | Idempotency | Exactly-once execution | Inngest queue |
  | State validation | Pre-determined transitions | FSM state machine |
