  | Inventory mismatch | No atomic updates | Use Inngest for exactly-once |
  | State corruption | Bypassing FSM | Enforce state validation |
- [ ] Section: Code Patterns
- [ ] Section: Related Subsystems
- [ ] Section: External References (Inngest docs, Stripe docs)

